flowchart TD
  Inventory[Full catalog and callback evidence] --> Resolve[Device and coherent type view]
  Resolve --> Admit[Canonical policy and wire admission]
  Client[MCP client] --> Admit
  Admit --> Proxy[Typed callback proxy and local reply policy]
  Android[Android callback sender] --> Proxy
  Proxy --> Broker[Kotlin headless callback broker]
  Broker --> Journal[Bounded SQLite event journal]
  Journal --> Resource[Authenticated MCP resource adapter]
  Resource --> Client
  Broker --> Cleanup[Verified cleanup and terminal state]
  UI[Compose management UI] --> Broker
